<title>POLAND: PEKPOL 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.31 vs   0.52 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.22 vs   0.38 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.76 vs   0.30 </p>
<p> Sales		   16.46 vs  17.30</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.91 vs   2.56</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.75 vs   3.25</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.48 vs   1.34</p>
<p> Sales		  197.86 vs 172.65</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food producer is Pekpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
